# Main-only git (adapted from laravel-phyzio)

| Owner said | Do | Do not |
|---|---|---|
| كومت / commit | commit on `main` | push, PR, new branch |
| ارفع / push | push `main` | open a PR |
| PR / افتح PR | open PR only then | invent a merge |

No `feature/*`, `fix/*`, `chore/*` branches unless explicitly asked.
